{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36649","headline":"夜泊毘陵无锡县有寄 · 罗隐","name":"夜泊毘陵无锡县有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草虫幽咽树初团，独系孤舟夜已阑。\n浊浪势奔吴苑急，疎钟声彻惠山寒。\n愁催鬓髪凋何易，贫恋家乡别渐难。\n他日亲朋应大笑，始知书劒是无端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}